{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_08_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_08","title":"亲族","storyCode":"SV-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3edd7c188b3228deb7f84c2e4c0a70ffacd562dd39dacc47a1581bad5c1d24b4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"杂种......你们两个杂种——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"使者！你在做什么？！你为什么留住她们？她们怎么值得你这么做？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"在她们对我们同胞大肆杀戮的时候，你们就该意识到她们和你绝对不是一种东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你是神圣的生命！她们只是污浊的残渣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啐）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很会适应，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们用冷兵器去砍杀你们，让你们对技术不那么敏感，不让你们进化成其他手段也解决不了的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我却高估你了。你太不敏感了......这都适应不了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来你习惯不了阿戈尔材料学造出来的刀刃。是不是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"使者，她在侮蔑你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教，主教......你还看不出吗？呵呵，是的，我就是有自信杀了你。我从最开始就能杀掉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"（低鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......（咳嗽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟，你为什么不接受？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"她们都是我姐妹。所以她们也是你姐妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我能唤起你，唤起Ishar-mla，当然......也唤起Gla-dia。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你因为你兄弟，游向浅海，就不认他，那样只是......不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，族群，都在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"不......妄言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道相信过你手中经书的任何字句？允我提醒，你也是在伊比利亚的眼皮底下宣传邪说，主教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它说什么我都无所谓，可你，深海教会的人，是不是把他的话都用本子记下来会比较好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了他们......杀了她们！使者！动手！她们犯下了大罪！他们亵渎了你，亵渎了海洋？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样要求......我真会这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你也无所谓，对吗？就像你和我说的一样，我这么要求也没问题！你会杀了她们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我依然无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"先去杀了那个......吟游诗人。把那个红衣服的先杀掉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"垃圾。是不是我让你去杀掉你身后的人，杀了你身后穿得像条海带的主教，你也会这么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"......！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他是我同胞，你也是我同胞。他在呼唤我，你也在呼唤我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人类啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人可真是又卑劣又丑陋。承认吧，主教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都是些愚蠢的阿戈尔人，喜欢把自己的想法去套在畜生身上。你根本不懂它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"杂种！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，如果你想保护我们的生命——为什么不拒绝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"拒绝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样......拒绝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，的确是劣等生物。你只游到这个深度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，垃圾，听好，我不会开口请你去杀你背后那个软蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是猎物。谁会恳求自己的猎物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想动她？你听从他的建议，想杀斯卡蒂，我的猎人？你不想再要那个答案了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了她也有其他办法。只要还有办法，我就无所谓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"但你说的，拒绝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太早了。咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咳血）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸。我不管你。你想杀她——你得先通得过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，Gla-dia。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你的生命能不能延续，你肉体以后还能不能活动，你来选能还是不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用相互猎杀来选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"相互......相互。是的。用相互捕食来选。你捕食我。我捕食你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
